Copy this file to `grafana_admin_password.secret` (same directory), then replace
its entire contents with a single strong Grafana admin login value on one line.

The real `grafana_admin_password.secret` is gitignored and must never be
committed; this `.example` is the only committed variant. `docker compose up`
hard-fails when the real secret file is missing, so there is no working default.

Generate a strong value, e.g.:

    openssl rand -base64 24

then put it (and nothing else) into grafana_admin_password.secret.
